  "description": "Doyoon is a mannequin that wants to become human. Through an accidental opportunity, he meets Jiho, who suffers from pediophobia (fear of dolls), and becomes her roommate. Doyoon becomes a human and Jiho has to overcome her trauma. The bizarre cohabitation of the two. Will it be successful?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=768466), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6079641)",
